      "repair_reason": "- No automated repair is needed because the current PR branch already contains the narrow code, test, and proof change; remaining action is normal maintainer merge review.; Cleared: Cleared: the diff adds a local Crestodian error catch plus test/proof code and does not add dependencies, workflows, secrets handling, downloaded code, or package-resolution changes. (sha=cf92a0c41af60ecc301f36eebe9ae0a4c4de1138)",
      "review_summary": "The PR adds an outer catch around `CrestodianTuiBackend.sendChat`'s fire-and-forget `respond` call and adds regression/proof coverage for a rejecting `respond` promise.\n\nPR surface: Source +5, Tests +68, Other +95. Total +168 across 3 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. I did not execute it in this read-only review, but source inspection gives a high-confidence path: make `respond()` reject and current main drops that promise, while the PR head catches it and emits a chat error.",
